    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Towounae adukokin nabo Akai ka Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete ŋimoe a ŋituŋa a Yuda ka a ŋituŋa a Benjamin atemar ŋirikon ŋulu aboŋunete anakwap a ŋina sek arikoritae ikes edukete Akai ka Akuj a Isirael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toloto ikes neni a Serubabel ka neni a Yesua ta neni a ŋikarikok a ŋatekerin, tolimokis ikes ebe, “Oduko kaapei ka iyes, anerae ilipyo isua daŋ neni ka Akuj kus lopite ŋolo ilipyata iyes, ido einanakinio isua neni keŋ ŋamuronisya ameun alorwa a ŋulu a erwosit Esaraadon a ŋolo ka Asiriya, a ŋolo ikiyauni isua ne.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai toboŋokis Serubabel ka Yesua ta ŋikarikok a ŋatekerin temasi neni kec, “Nyipedorete iyes akitiya kaapei ka isua akiduk Akai aŋuna ka Akuj kosi, nai ikiduki isua make Akai aŋuna ke Ekapolon Akuj a Isirael, lopite ŋolo ikicikitor isua erwosit Kirus ŋolo a Perisia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋituŋa ŋulu sek eboiyete anakwap a ŋin kitakadakis ŋituŋa a ekabila a Yuda, tokuryaketa akiduk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido apotu ikes kiluŋuluŋa ŋikapolokinitok a ŋituŋa ka akwap a Perisia, ikotere nyecamakis ŋituŋa a ekabila a Yuda edukete nabo Akai ka Akuj. Torubakis ikes itiyaete ŋun ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu epukator Kirus akitodol apaki ŋina aruworor Darius ekepukan a Perisia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Towounae adukokin nabo Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋina epukator erwosit Auseuro alokaru a ŋolo ageunia iŋes akipuka, apotu ŋimoe a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Yuda kigira abaruwa itoroniarito ŋituŋa ŋulu eboiyete alo Yudaya ka alo Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi alorwa a ŋulu epukator Aritaseses apotu Bisilam, Misiredas, Tabeel kaapei ka ŋirukitos kec ŋuluce, kigira abaruwa neni a erwosit Aritaseses a ŋolo a Perisia; egiritae abaruwa ŋin a Ŋaramaniae ka amaikina kibelekinoe naŋajep ŋina a ŋituŋa a Perisia apaki ŋina eswomere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Reum ŋolo ewuapit erwosit anapolou ka Simisai ekegirigiran, kigira abaruwa neni a erwosit Aritaseses itoroniarito Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Apotu nai Reum ŋolo ewuapit erwosit anapolou ka Simisai ekegirigiran ta ŋirukitos kec ŋuluce: Ŋikatubok ŋakiro, ŋikiyakia, ŋikapolok ŋulu epukato kaapei ke erwosit, Ŋiperisi, ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Erek, Ŋibabiloniyae, ŋituŋa a Susa ikes Ŋielami ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin ŋuluce ŋulu kebu koloŋ arwonit ekapolon Osinapar toriko kisiboiyo lotaunio ŋulu a Samaria ka nakiboisyo ŋunace Alokekwaye Aŋolol Eupurate ŋuna epukat erwosit a Perisia, kigira abaruwa neni ka Aritaserses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋuna apotu ikes kigira nabaruwa ŋin ikes nu):",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neni a erwosit Aritaseses, ikiyakikinito iyoŋ ŋiketiyak kon, ŋituŋa ŋulu iboiyete Alokekwaye Aŋolol Eupurate emalas. Tosodi tokona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikilipi iyoŋ erwosit toyenu atemar aloto Yerusalem Ŋiburaniyae ŋulu apote aneni kon neni kosi. Edukete ikes nabo etaun ŋol ŋolo a ŋikaŋerok ka a ŋikaronok, aapuu ikes akirikakin akiduk nabo ŋarwatatain ka esubanakinete ŋakisyakineta a ŋarwatatain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokona ikilipi iyoŋ erwosit toyenu atemar, ani kedukokin nabo etaun lo ka kirikakin adukokin ŋarwatatain, ejoŋoete ŋituŋa lu akitac ocur ka etacit ŋolo sek amaikina ikes tolemut aloboro a ŋulu eyakatar ikes, kori egyelanarete, aŋun, ekudyokunete ŋiboro ŋulu sek elemununuyo aŋuna ke erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋuna tokona erwosit ikiyarikinitor isua kai a apukan, nyikicamit isua akitere ŋituŋa pa itopoloorito erwosit, aŋun, iyakuunitae isua abaruwa na akiteyenikin iyoŋ erwosit ŋakiro ŋun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikotere toripuripuinae anakigireta a ŋuna atapapaa kon. Iryamuni iyoŋ anakigireta a ŋun atemar erae etaun lo ŋolo a ŋikaŋerok ka esicanito ŋituŋa keŋ ŋirwosi ka ŋikapolok ŋulu ipukatotor ŋirwosi. Erae etaun ŋolo a ŋikaŋerok ŋinapeikoloŋ, ŋakiro ŋun iŋes aponere kinyasunae etaun ŋol toruwor ereŋorot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiteyenikinitae isua iyoŋ erwosit atemar kedukokin nabo etaun ŋol, kirikakin adukokin ŋarwatatain keŋ, emamukaun ibore erae ŋini a erwosit anakwap a ŋina alokekwaye aŋolol Eupurate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya erwosit aboŋokinet keŋ na, “Neni a Reum a ŋolo iwuapit erwosit anapolou ka Simisai ekegirigiran ka neni a ŋirukitos kec a ŋuluce a daadaŋ ŋulu iboiyete alo Samaria ka a nakwap a ŋina alokekwaye aŋolol Eupurate, ekemalae ayoŋ iyes. Tosodi tokona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adaun akisyom abaruwa ŋina ikigirakinete iyes ayoŋ ka akibeleun ŋakiro keŋ alokiŋaren kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu ayoŋ otub atemar toripuripunae ŋakiro ŋun, ido adaun kire aripun atemar ŋinapei alorwa a ŋulu koloŋ keŋereneneete ŋituŋa a Yerusalem ŋirwosi ka ayakatar Yerusalem ŋituŋa ŋulu aŋerito ŋapukasinei ka ayakatar ŋituŋa ŋulu esyaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar Yerusalem ŋirwosi ŋulu agogoŋok ŋulu epukato akwap daadaŋ ŋina alokekwaye aŋolol Eupurate, ido alemenakinio ikes ocur ka etacit ŋolo alemununyete ŋituŋa aloboro a ŋulu ayakatar ikes, kori a ŋulu agyelanarete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, emaikina iyes tolimokis ŋituŋa ŋul atemar tojoŋoto akitiya etic ŋol ka atemar nyedukokin nabo etaun ŋol akitodol ŋina atubunio ayoŋ ŋakiro kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyijamakis jik ŋakiro ŋun, ikotere nyaryamu ayoŋ ajamuwaro adio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
